===[[Pokémon Masters EX]]===
{{main|Argenta (Masters)}}
Argenta forms a [[sync pair]] with {{p|Skarmory}} in [[Pokémon Masters EX]]. Her Skarmory is capable of [[Dynamax]]ing. Argenta became a playable sync pair on September 18, 2023.

Argenta first appeared as an NPC during the [[story event]] [[Tower Tycoon and Hall Matron]].

